<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten pellets flat-down, meal unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten pellets flat-down, meal unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed pellet prices were flat to lower Thursday and meal prices were steady in moderate trade, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>   CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   87.00     87.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     spot     -  360.00    360.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   80.00     82.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  360.00    360.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
